        "First Battle of Panipat (1526): Babur established Mughal rule by defeating Delhi Sultan Ibrahim Lodi.",
        "Mansabdari System: Introduced by Akbar as the backbone of Mughal civil and military administration.",
        "Din-i-Ilahi: A syncretic ethical code established by Akbar in 1582.",
        "Jizya Tax: Abolished by Akbar in 1564 and re-imposed by Aurangzeb in 1679."
